    "Everyone here reached": "Todos aquí alcanzaron",
    ". They tried almost every tool, read the Learn topics, answered the check questions and met the lab challenges. That's the": ". Probaron casi todas las herramientas, leyeron Aprende, respondieron preguntas y superaron retos. Eso es el",
    "Join the Hall of Fame": "Únete al Salón de la Fama",
    "How Adeebo Points work": "Cómo funcionan Adeebo Points",
    "The winners": "Los ganadores",
    "Adeebo Points are a small reward for learning AdeeboMeter and how networks work. They're on from the start; you can switch them off in Settings › Adeebo Points (your total is kept). Every item pays": "Adeebo Points es una pequeña recompensa por aprender AdeeboMeter y redes. Están activos por defecto. Puedes desactivarlos en Ajustes › Adeebo Points conservando el total. Cada elemento da puntos",
    "once": "una vez",
