    "1 connection check found real trouble.": "1 prueba encontró problemas reales.",
    "Best around {time}": "Mejor alrededor de {time}",
    ", slowest around {time}": ", peor alrededor de {time}",
    "Every check you run on this phone adds to it - My connection, Is it down, games, calls. Kept on this phone only, for 7 days.": "Cada prueba del teléfono añade datos: Mi conexión, ¿Está caído?, juegos y llamadas. Solo aquí, durante 7 días.",
    "ms, the middle of each day's connection checks. Red: a check that day found real trouble. Days without checks are empty.": "ms, mediana de las pruebas de cada día. Rojo: se encontró un problema real. Días sin pruebas quedan vacíos.",
    "BASE64 · {count} BYTES": "BASE64 · {count} BYTES",
    "BASE64 · {count} BYTES OF BINARY": "BASE64 · {count} BYTES BINARIOS",
    "All {count} characters.": "Los {count} caracteres completos.",
    "The first 4,000 of {count} characters.": "Primeros 4,000 de {count} caracteres.",
    "CERTIFICATE REQUEST": "SOLICITUD DE CERTIFICADO",
    "Paste -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----, a CSR, a JWT (eyJ...) or Base64": "Pega -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----, CSR, JWT (eyJ...) o Base64",
    "Nothing answered on TCP {port}. Check: the device is on and the app is running, the router forwards {port} to that device, and its firewall allows it. If the router's WAN address starts with 100.64-100.127, your provider uses carrier NAT - ask for a public address.": "Nada respondió en TCP {port}. Comprueba dispositivo y app encendidos, redirección del router a {port} y permiso del firewall. Si la WAN empieza por 100.64-100.127, hay NAT del operador: pide IP pública.",
    "You're on Cloudflare WARP or a similar service. Turn it off and test again.": "Usas Cloudflare WARP o similar. Desactívalo y repite.",
    "On mobile data this is normal: carriers share one address between many customers (carrier NAT), so nothing can be opened. Test on your home Wi-Fi.": "En datos móviles es normal: el operador comparte IP entre clientes y no puedes abrir puertos. Prueba en Wi-Fi doméstico.",
    "none, and no address either - mail to @{domain} can't be delivered": "ninguno ni dirección: no puede entregarse correo a @{domain}",
    "{count} SPF records - only one is allowed; receivers treat it as broken": "{count} registros SPF: solo se permite uno; se consideran incorrectos",
    "{count} DMARC records - only one is allowed; receivers ignore them all": "{count} registros DMARC: solo se permite uno; se ignoran todos",
    "missing - anyone can pretend to send as @{domain}": "falta: cualquiera puede fingir enviar como @{domain}",
    "strict (-all): others are refused": "estricto (-all): rechaza los demás",
    "soft (~all): others are marked as suspicious": "suave (~all): marca los demás como sospechosos",
    "neutral (?all): doesn't protect": "neutro (?all): no protege",
    "+all lets anyone send as you - fix it": "+all permite suplantarte: corrígelo",
    "Works, but an MX record is the reliable way to receive mail.": "Funciona, pero MX es la forma fiable de recibir correo.",
    "From Cloudflare's DNS · {time}": "DNS de Cloudflare · {time}",
    "From the public registration database (RDAP) · {time}": "Registro público RDAP · {time}",
    "Only the first half ({prefix}) is looked up - the rest stays on this phone.": "Solo se consulta la primera mitad ({prefix}); el resto queda en el teléfono.",
    "Phones and laptops make up an address per network for privacy, so it doesn't belong to a maker.": "Teléfonos y portátiles crean direcciones privadas por red. No corresponden a un fabricante.",
    "Can't be checked from outside without the sender's selector name": "No se comprueba desde fuera sin el selector del remitente",
    "can't be checked from outside without the sender's selector name": "no se comprueba desde fuera sin el selector del remitente",
    "Look at a real email's headers: DKIM-Signature: ... s=<selector>.": "Mira las cabeceras de un correo real: DKIM-Signature: ... s=<selector>.",
    " - only watching; fakes still arrive": " — solo observa; las suplantaciones llegan",
