    "Free keys from these services unlock more. Kept only on this phone; each goes, through our relay, to its own service for that one request - never stored or logged.": "这些服务的免费密钥可解锁更多内容。只保留在这部手机上；每个请求都会通过我们的中继到达其自己的服务 - 从未存储或记录。",
