    "Dhaka (DSE) - not yet": "达卡 (DSE) - 尚未",
    "Data: Bank of Canada (a week of rates and the commodity index),": "数据：加拿大央行（一周利率和商品指数），",
    "(every other currency), ESPN (scores, standings and league headlines - an unofficial feed that can change), BBC Sport (cricket, tennis and F1 headlines), Alpha Vantage (US stock movers, end of day), Open-Meteo (weather, CC BY 4.0). With your own keys: football-data.org, CricketData and GNews. Fetched through a small cache so the sources never see your address; nothing is saved.": "（所有其他货币）、ESPN（比分、排名和联赛头条新闻 - 可以更改的非官方提要）、BBC 体育（板球、网球和 F1 头条新闻）、Alpha Vantage（美国股票走势，收盘）、Open-Meteo（天气，CC BY 4.0）。使用你自己的密钥：football-data.org、CricketData 和 GNews。通过小型缓存获取，因此源永远不会看到你的地址；什么都没有保存。",
