    "Path & routing": "路径和路由",
    "MTU per hop, MTR, the way back, which route, your gateway (VRRP / HSRP), routing protocols on your segment, IPv6.": "MTU 每跳，MTR，返回方式，哪条路由，你的网关（VRRP / HSRP），你网段上的路由协议，IPv6。",
    "Is it reachable?": "是否可达？",
