    "AdeeboMeter for gaming - whose lag is it?": "AdeeboMeter 游戏 - 谁的滞后？",
    "Whose lag is it?": "到底哪里导致卡顿？",
    "Valorant, Fortnite, League of Legends, Counter-Strike 2, Roblox and more - AdeeboMeter knows their servers. It watches the ones you play on, notices when a game opens, and tells you whether the lag was you, your Wi-Fi, your provider or the game.": "《Valorant》、《堡垒之夜》、《英雄联盟》、《反恐精英》2、Roblox 等 - AdeeboMeter 了解他们的服务器。它会监视你玩的游戏，注意到游戏何时打开，并告诉你延迟是由你、你的 Wi-Fi、你的运营商还是游戏造成的。",
    "The Gamer page: your ping, jitter and loss right now, and the games you can add": "玩家页面：你现在的 ping、抖动和丢失情况，以及你可以添加的游戏",
    "Your best server": "你最好的服务器",
    "Each region's ping, jitter and loss, and the one that suits you - measured over a week, evenings included.": "每个区域的 ping、抖动和丢失情况，以及适合你的区域 - 在一周内（包括晚上）进行测量。",
    "Every second while you play": "玩耍时的每一秒",
    "When a game opens, its servers are checked every second, and spikes are kept with whose fault they were.": "当游戏开始时，它的服务器每秒都会被检查一次，并且尖峰会被保留在谁的错误中。",
    "Match reports": "比赛报道",
    "After a session: the spikes, the worst moments and what caused them - in plain words.": "训练结束后：尖峰、最糟糕的时刻以及导致它们的原因 - 用简单的话来说。",
    "Test under load": "负载测试",
    "Does a download in the house wreck your ping? One test shows it.": "家里的下载是否会破坏你的 ping 值？一项测试表明了这一点。",
    "Report for your ISP": "为你的 ISP 报告",
    "The route to your game's server, hop by hop, and where the loss starts - with every rough minute of the week from your records.": "到游戏服务器的路线、逐跳以及损失开始的位置 - 从你的记录中了解一周中的每一分钟。",
    "Any game": "任何游戏",
    "Add your own game with any server address.": "使用任何服务器地址添加你自己的游戏。",
    "Nothing is sent to game servers until you add a game. Then: pings (or timed connections) to its regions, at the pace you choose in Settings.": "在你添加游戏之前，不会将任何内容发送到游戏服务器。然后：按照你在“设置”中选择的速度对其区域进行 ping（或定时连接）。",
