    "Everyone here reached": "这里的每个人都达到了",
    ". They tried almost every tool, read the Learn topics, answered the check questions and met the lab challenges. That's the": "。他们尝试了几乎所有工具，阅读学习主题，回答检查问题并应对实验室挑战。这就是",
    "Join the Hall of Fame": "加入名人堂",
    "How Adeebo Points work": "Adeebo Points 的工作原理",
    "The winners": "获奖者",
    "Adeebo Points are a small reward for learning AdeeboMeter and how networks work. They're on from the start; you can switch them off in Settings › Adeebo Points (your total is kept). Every item pays": "Adeebo Points 是学习 AdeeboMeter 以及网络如何工作的小奖励。他们从一开始就开始了；你可以在“设置”>“Adeebo Points”中将其关闭（保留你的总数）。每件商品均需付费",
