    "About 750 points in all - tools, Learn topics and questions, Labs and Games - so 500 means you've done two thirds of everything. Tools that send test traffic or scan a network (Traffic Lab senders, ping sweep, finding devices) never pay points - nobody should do that just for points.": "关于 750 的所有要点 - 工具、学习主题和问题、实验室和游戏 - 所以 500 意味着你已经完成了所有事情的三分之二。发送测试流量或扫描网络的工具（流量实验室发送器、ping 扫描、查找设备）从不支付积分 - 没有人应该仅仅为了积分而这样做。",
