    "Type at least the first half of the address, like 3C:84:6A": "至少输入地址的前半部分，例如 3C:84:6A",
    "Couldn't reach our small server - try again in a moment.": "无法访问我们的小型服务器 - 请稍后再试。",
    "That didn't work - check the connection and try again.": "这不起作用 - 检查连接并重试。",
    "Cloudflare's speed test servers didn't answer - check the connection.": "Cloudflare 的速度测试服务器没有响应 - 检查连接。",
    "Download, upload and how much the delay grows while the line is busy. Straight to Cloudflare's speed test servers - nothing goes through AdeeboMeter.": "下载、上传以及线路繁忙时延迟会增加多少。直接到 Cloudflare 的速度测试服务器 - 没有任何内容经过 AdeeboMeter。",
    "Start the test": "开始测试",
    "On mobile data: uses up to about 40 MB": "移动数据：最多使用约 40 MB",
