    "listed": "列出",
    "Mail from this address shouldn't be refused because of these lists.": "来自该地址的邮件不应因为这些列表而被拒绝。",
    "Mail sent straight from this address may be refused or land in spam. On home or mobile data that's common and harmless - your email app sends through its own server. If you run a mail server here, ask each list for removal.": "直接从此地址发送的邮件可能会被拒绝或落入垃圾邮件。对于常见且无害的家庭或移动数据 - 你的电子邮件应用程序通过其自己的服务器发送。如果你在此处运行邮件服务器，请要求删除每个列表。",
    "LAST 7 DAYS · THIS PHONE · {count} CHECKS": "最后 7 天 · 此手机 · {count} 检查",
