    "Best around {time}": "{time}附近最好",
    ", slowest around {time}": ", {time} 附近最慢",
    "Every check you run on this phone adds to it - My connection, Is it down, games, calls. Kept on this phone only, for 7 days.": "你在此手机上运行的每项检查都会添加到它 - 我的连接、是否已关闭、游戏、通话。仅保留在这部手机上，7 天。",
    "ms, the middle of each day's connection checks. Red: a check that day found real trouble. Days without checks are empty.": "ms，每天中间的连接检查。红色：当天检查发现确实有麻烦。没有检查的日子是空虚的。",
