    "CERTIFICATE REQUEST": "证书申请",
    "Paste -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----, a CSR, a JWT (eyJ...) or Base64": "粘贴 -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----、CSR、JWT (eyJ...) 或 Base64",
    "Nothing answered on TCP {port}. Check: the device is on and the app is running, the router forwards {port} to that device, and its firewall allows it. If the router's WAN address starts with 100.64-100.127, your provider uses carrier NAT - ask for a public address.": "TCP {port} 上没有任何答复。检查：设备已打开并且应用程序正在运行，路由器将 {port} 转发到该设备，并且其防火墙允许。如果路由器的 WAN 地址以 100.64-100.127 开头，则你的运营商使用运营商 NAT - 请求公共地址。",
    "You're on Cloudflare WARP or a similar service. Turn it off and test again.": "你使用的是 Cloudflare WARP 或类似服务。将其关闭并再次测试。",
    "On mobile data this is normal: carriers share one address between many customers (carrier NAT), so nothing can be opened. Test on your home Wi-Fi.": "在移动数据上，这是正常的：运营商在许多客户之间共享一个地址（运营商 NAT），因此无法打开任何内容。在你家的 Wi-Fi 上进行测试。",
    "none, and no address either - mail to @{domain} can't be delivered": "没有，也没有地址 - 无法投递至@{domain} 的邮件",
    "{count} SPF records - only one is allowed; receivers treat it as broken": "{count} SPF 记录 - 只允许一条；接收者将其视为损坏",
    "{count} DMARC records - only one is allowed; receivers ignore them all": "{count} DMARC 记录 - 只允许一条；接收者全部忽略它们",
    "missing - anyone can pretend to send as @{domain}": "失踪 - 任何人都可以假装以@{domain} 的身份发送",
    "strict (-all): others are refused": "strict (-all): 其他的都被拒绝",
    "soft (~all): others are marked as suspicious": "软（〜全部）：其他被标记为可疑",
    "neutral (?all): doesn't protect": "中性（？全部）：不保护",
    "+all lets anyone send as you - fix it": "+all 允许任何人像你一样发送 - 修复它",
    "Works, but an MX record is the reliable way to receive mail.": "可以，但 MX 记录是接收邮件的可靠方式。",
