    "Strength sat around {strength} dBm - far from the tower or deep indoors. Near a window or outside it gets better; at home, Wi-Fi calling helps.": "强度约为 {strength} dBm - 远离塔楼或深入室内。靠近窗户或外面情况会更好；在家里，Wi-Fi 打电话有帮助。",
    "Strength is fine ({strength} dBm) but {detail}. Distance isn't the problem, so moving a little rarely helps; another time of day often does.": "强度很好（{strength} dBm），但 {detail}。距离不是问题，所以稍微移动一下很少有帮助；一天中的另一个时间经常会这样。",
    "Strength around {strength} dBm: still working, but the first to slow down when the cell gets busy.": "{strength} dBm 左右的强度：仍在工作，但当小区繁忙时首先会减慢。",
    "Quality fell to {quality} dB for about {duration}{start} - a crowded cell; pages and video slow down there.": "质量下降到 {quality} dB 大约 {duration}{start} - 一个拥挤的小区；页面和视频速度变慢。",
    "The two antennas differ by {gap} dB - one is covered (your hand, a thick case, or the way the phone faces). Hold it differently or try landscape; the phone gets up to twice the speed with both.": "两根天线相差 {gap} dB - 一根天线被覆盖（你的手、厚外壳或手机面向的方式）。以不同的方式握住它或尝试横向；两者的结合使手机速度提高了一倍。",
    "{count} changes in {duration}{returns} - you're on the edge between towers. Calls drop and video stalls here; it's the place, not the phone.": "{count} 在 {duration}{returns} 中的变化 - 你位于塔之间的边缘。此处电话掉线和视频卡顿；这是地方，而不是电话。",
    "5G was there in {count} of {total} moments. Each switch is a short pause; if it bothers you, LTE only (Settings › Mobile Data › Voice & Data) is steadier here.": "5G 出现在 {count} 和 {total} 时刻。每次切换都是短暂的停顿；如果你感到困扰，只有 LTE（设置 > 移动数据 > 语音和数据）在这里更稳定。",
    "The tracking area changed ({areas}) - the network re-registers you; a second or two of nothing is normal.": "追踪区域改变（{areas}）——网络重新注册你；一两秒钟没有任何反应是正常的。",
