    "(in History): when your internet went quiet and when it came back, so the Outages list and the Report for my ISP can show them. Times only - nothing about what you were doing. It goes with History: turning History off stops it, and old days roll off with the rest.": "（属于历史记录）：记录断网和恢复时间，供断网列表和运营商报告使用。只记时间，不记你在做什么。关闭历史也会停止此记录，旧数据随历史一起清理。",
    "Devices on your networks": "各网络中的设备",
