    "Remembered phones": "已记住的手机",
    ", only if you said yes to \"Remember this phone\"): each phone's name and its own key, locked to your Windows account. Forget my phones empties it.": "，仅在你同意“记住此手机”后）：各手机的名称与专属密钥，绑定你的 Windows 账户。“忘记我的手机”可清空。",
    "): the games and servers you added in the Gamer Zone, and Valve's public server list when you refresh it - and, while History is on, a line a minute for each server you watch.": "）：玩家专区中添加的游戏与服务器，以及刷新时获得的 Valve 公共服务器列表。开启历史时，还会每分钟记录所监测服务器。",
    "): the keys you added for football-data.org or CricketData, locked to your Windows account, and today's count of CricketData calls.": "）：你添加的 football-data.org 或 CricketData 密钥，绑定 Windows 账户，以及当天 CricketData 请求次数。",
    ", the Bank of Canada history files): today's count of quote calls with your own key, and the exchange-rate history the charts are drawn from.": "，加拿大银行历史文件）：当天使用自有密钥的行情请求次数，以及绘图所需的汇率历史。",
    "): the stream links you saved, locked to your Windows account, and the results of your checks.": "）：你保存的播放链接，绑定 Windows 账户，以及检查结果。",
