    "This page isn't here": "此页面不存在",
    "The link may be old, or the address has a typo. Everything AdeeboMeter has is one tap away:": "链接可能过旧，或地址有拼写错误。AdeeboMeter 的全部内容都可在这里找到：",
    "Home and download": "主页与下载",
    "Phone app": "手机应用",
    "AdeeboMeter on your phone: your PC's live numbers, the devices on your network, guided checks, encrypted file transfer, and lessons and games that work offline.": "手机上的 AdeeboMeter：查看电脑实时数据、网络设备、引导检查、加密文件传输，以及可离线使用的课程和游戏。",
    "Lock a file with a code, or open a .adeebo file someone sent you - on your phone, offline. Nothing is uploaded; it all happens in your browser.": "在手机离线使用解锁码加密文件，或打开别人发来的 .adeebo 文件。不会上传，全部在浏览器中完成。",
    "Free quick games to learn networking: a 10-question quiz, put the conversation in order (DNS, DHCP, TLS…), subnet sprint and port match. Works on any phone, no sign-up.": "免费网络知识小游戏：10 题测验、DNS、DHCP、TLS 等通信排序、子网冲刺和端口配对。手机即可玩，无需注册。",
    "Network games | AdeeboMeter": "网络小游戏 | AdeeboMeter",
    "Quiz, conversation order, subnet sprint and port match - learn how the internet works in a minute a game.": "测验、通信排序、子网冲刺和端口配对，每局一分钟，了解互联网如何工作。",
    "Lag in Valorant, Fortnite, League, CS2 or Roblox? AdeeboMeter pings your game's servers, tells you whose lag it is and builds the proof for your provider. Free, offline, for Windows.": "Valorant、Fortnite、League、CS2 或 Roblox 卡顿？AdeeboMeter 检查游戏服务器，指出原因并生成给运营商的证据。免费，离线运行，适用于 Windows。",
    "The people who reached 500 Adeebo Points and earned the Adeebo Award - and how Adeebo Points work: what earns them, the ranks, the learning paths and how to join.": "达到 500 Adeebo Points 并获得 Adeebo Award 的用户，以及积分获取、等级、学习路径和加入方式。",
    "AdeeboMeter Hall of Fame": "AdeeboMeter 名人堂",
    "500 Adeebo Points: every tool tried, every topic read, every lab challenge met.": "500 Adeebo Points：尝试工具、阅读主题、完成实验挑战。",
    "About 1,000 points in all - tools, Learn topics and questions, Labs and Games - so 500 means you've done half of everything. Tools that send test traffic or scan a network (Traffic Lab senders, ping sweep, finding devices) never pay points - nobody should do that just for points.": "工具、学习主题、自测、实验和游戏总计约 1,000 分，因此 500 分意味着完成约一半内容。会发送测试流量或扫描网络的工具，包括流量发送器、ping 扫描和设备发现，不奖励积分，避免为了得分运行测试。",
