    "and you'll be removed.": "，我们就会移除你的记录。",
    "Free Windows 10/11 network troubleshooter. No admin rights, no cloud, no telemetry. One glance tells you if it's your PC, Wi-Fi, ISP, DNS or the internet.": "免费的 Windows 10/11 网络诊断工具，无需管理员权限、云端或遥测。一眼判断问题在电脑、Wi-Fi、ISP、DNS 还是互联网。",
    "AdeeboMeter — Is it me or the network?": "AdeeboMeter — 是电脑还是网络的问题？",
    "Free network troubleshooter for Windows, local-first. One glance tells you whether your PC, Wi-Fi, ISP, DNS or the internet is the problem. No cloud, no telemetry, no admin rights.": "免费、本地运行的 Windows 网络诊断工具。一眼判断问题在电脑、Wi-Fi、ISP、DNS 还是互联网。无云端、无遥测，无需管理员权限。",
