    "Windows feeds the Monitor, which produces a snapshot every second for the widget and the engineer view": "Windows 向监测器提供数据，监测器每秒生成快照，供小组件和工程师视图使用",
    "300+ terms and 72 programs explained. Ctrl+K jumps to anything.": "解释 300+ 个术语和 72 个程序，Ctrl+K 可跳转到任意内容。",
    "Channel map example": "信道图示例",
    "Example path: your PC, your network, Rogers, NTT, Wikipedia": "路径示例：电脑、你的网络、Rogers、NTT、Wikipedia",
    "account · telemetry · an updater · ads · crash reports sent · listening ports": "账号 · 遥测 · 自动更新器 · 广告 · 崩溃上报 · 监听端口",
    "99 MB": "99 MB",
    "100 checks on your own PC, written to": "在你自己的电脑上运行 100 项检查，写入",
    "Explore the phone app": "体验手机应用",
    "Windows 11 23H2 · AdeeboMeter 1.1": "Windows 11 23H2 · AdeeboMeter 1.1",
    "Watch live download and upload rates on Windows with AdeeboMeter. Check data usage and replay connection slowdowns with local history.": "用 AdeeboMeter 查看 Windows 实时下载与上传速度，检查流量用量，并通过本地历史回放连接变慢的时刻。",
    "Use AdeeboMeter to measure packet loss on Windows and create a connection report you can share with your internet provider.": "使用 AdeeboMeter 在 Windows 测量丢包，生成可分享给运营商的连接报告。",
    "AdeeboLab · AdeeboMeter": "AdeeboLab · AdeeboMeter",
    "Draw your network, see the path a packet takes from your PC to a game, broker or stream, then break one thing and watch where it fails. Free, nothing is sent.": "画出网络，查看数据包从电脑到游戏、券商或播放源的路径，再模拟一处故障并观察失败位置。免费，不发送流量。",
    "AdeeboLab start page": "AdeeboLab 起始页",
    "Start page": "起始页",
