    "The AdeeboMeter poster: what it does - the corner widget, What's wrong?, the ISP report, 232 tools, AdeeboShell, AdeeboLab and more": "AdeeboMeter 功能海报：角落小组件、问题诊断、运营商报告、232 个工具、AdeeboShell、AdeeboLab 等",
    "Free browser network simulator: AdeeboLab | AdeeboMeter": "免费浏览器网络模拟器：AdeeboLab | AdeeboMeter",
    "Draw a network in AdeeboLab, choose a simulated fault and follow a packet step by step. A free browser network simulator with no real traffic sent.": "在 AdeeboLab 中绘制网络、设置模拟故障，并逐步跟踪数据包。免费的浏览器网络模拟器，不会发送真实网络流量。",
    "Break a network. See where it stops.": "模拟网络故障，看看数据包停在哪里。",
    "Try a fault on a drawing before you investigate a real connection. AdeeboLab simulates the journey; it does not measure your network.": "先在图中模拟故障，再排查真实连接。AdeeboLab 模拟数据包的传输过程，不测量实际网络。",
