    "A teaching picture: the wrong gateway stops this example before the packet reaches the provider. It is not a reading from your connection.": "教学示意图：此处网关设置错误，数据包无法到达运营商。这并非您实际连接的测量结果。",
    "Try a two-minute experiment": "用两分钟做个实验",
    "Open AdeeboLab and choose the Gamer example. The provider equipment is an illustration, not discovered hardware.": "打开 AdeeboLab，选择 Gamer 示例。图中的运营商设备仅作示意，并非探测到的实际硬件。",
