    "Press Play. Use Step or Step back to follow the explanation at your own pace.": "按 Play 开始。使用 Step 或 Step back，按自己的节奏查看每一步说明。",
    "Try DNS times out next. Notice how a name lookup failure differs from a packet that cannot leave the PC.": "接着尝试 DNS times out，比较域名查询失败与数据包无法离开电脑的区别。",
