    "Learn the failure. Then check the real thing.": "先理解故障，再检查实际连接。",
    "Use AdeeboLab for the explanation and AdeeboMeter for readings from your Windows PC.": "用 AdeeboLab 理解原理，用 AdeeboMeter 获取 Windows 电脑的实际测量结果。",
