    "Open the full AdeeboMeter window and choose AdeeboShell. Ctrl + ` opens it from another page in the app.": "打开 AdeeboMeter 完整窗口，选择 AdeeboShell。在应用的其他页面中，可按 Ctrl + ` 打开。",
    "Type status and press Enter. Read what the app has measured so far; an unavailable reading is not a pass.": "输入 status 并按 Enter，查看已有的测量结果；没有测量结果并不代表检查通过。",
    "Type ls /tools to explore the tool groups. Use help before trying an unfamiliar command.": "输入 ls /tools 浏览工具分组。尝试不熟悉的命令前，请先使用 help。",
    "Tab completes a command. Ctrl+C stops the current command.": "Tab 可补全命令，Ctrl+C 可停止当前命令。",
