    "No. Windows folders and drives are read-only in AdeeboShell. File changes stay inside AdeeboMeter’s /data folder.": "不能。AdeeboShell 中的 Windows 文件夹和磁盘为只读，文件修改仅限 AdeeboMeter 的 /data 文件夹。",
