    "MsMpEng.exe is Microsoft Defender's Antimalware Service Executable. Learn what it does and compare CPU and disk use when Windows feels slow.": "MsMpEng.exe 是 Microsoft Defender 的反恶意软件服务进程。了解它的作用，并在 Windows 变慢时比较 CPU 和磁盘占用。",
    "MsMpEng.exe is Microsoft Defender’s Antimalware Service Executable. It checks files for malware; scan activity can use CPU and disk.": "MsMpEng.exe 是 Microsoft Defender 的反恶意软件服务进程，负责检查文件中的恶意软件；扫描时可能占用 CPU 和磁盘。",
