    "svchost.exe hosts Windows services. Learn why several copies run and how to compare a busy instance's CPU and disk activity.": "svchost.exe 承载 Windows 服务。了解为何会有多个实例，以及如何比较繁忙实例的 CPU 和磁盘活动。",
    "svchost.exe is Windows Service Host. Each instance hosts one or more services. Several instances can be normal; identify the busy service before changing anything.": "svchost.exe 是 Windows 服务主机，每个实例承载一项或多项服务。多个实例通常属于正常情况；更改设置前，请先找出繁忙的服务。",
